       RELEASES     the version from the repository's VERSION file and the
                    release date (R39)
       SCREENSHOTS  ATECH_SCREENSHOT_URLS, or a PLACEHOLDER comment while no
                    screenshot is hosted. Never an invented URL.

     project_license (ADR-006, owner 2026-10-03) covers ATECH'S OWN FILES
     ONLY: Atech's code is LGPL-2.1-or-later and the Atech module models and
     presets.yaml are CC BY-NC 4.0. Both kinds ship in the image, so the SPDX
     expression is a conjunction (AND), not a choice (OR). FreeCAD ("LGPL2+"
     per its LICENSE.html; its source files mostly LGPL-2.1-or-later), the
     libraries it bundles and the AppImage runtime keep their own licences,
     listed in usr/share/doc/ (CREDITS.md, packages.txt); an expression
