  <name>Atech Atelier</name>
  <summary>Parametric CAD with a built-in design agent</summary>
  <developer id="dev.atech">
    <name>Atech</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Atech Atelier is built on FreeCAD 1.1.3 and adds the Atech agent
      workbench: describe a part in plain language and the agent writes,
      runs and measures a FreeCAD script, then shows the result in the 3D
      view.
    </p>
