      unmodified (FreeCAD's LICENSE.html: "LGPL2+"; its source files:
      LGPL-2.1-or-later), and is not endorsed by, affiliated with, or a
      product of the FreeCAD project or the FreeCAD Project Association.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">dev.atech.Atelier.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/atechdotdev/atech-atelier</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/atechdotdev/atech-atelier/issues</url>
